      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Finally, let's discuss the common Tactical skills that will help you in your Coding Career:",
      "source_hash": 8985652385807892417,
      "context_hash": 11015443868254203312,
      "translation": "마지막으로, 코딩 커리어에 도움이 될 일반적인 전술적 기술에 대해 이야기해 봅시다:",
